    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck of Treads is a chaotic 2-6 player tank brawler with a deckbuilding twist. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The losers of each round pick powerful upgrades, stacking wild abilities that change how you play. Every match escalates into unpredictable mayhem with hilarious, over-the-top tank builds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/c7e444e68789adba3a83009cd9efe78d.webp?t=1752449019\" width=153 height=27 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brawl with friends in ever-changing, procedurally generated arenas where no two matches are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/2ab92cb88044074fc1d1889791f0723c.poster.avif?t=1752449019\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/2ab92cb88044074fc1d1889791f0723c.webm?t=1752449019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/6c47ff1e9506b98643bf29bc5bd0f056.webp?t=1752449019\" width=192 height=27 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The losers of each round choose powerful upgrades that transform their tanks. With endless combos and wild synergies, no two builds play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/055f222303150379489ca46b8bfbfad1.poster.avif?t=1752449019\" width=800 height=333 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/055f222303150379489ca46b8bfbfad1.webm?t=1752449019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/1dac041b5b56eb88a3d0c540821150f3.webp?t=1752449019\" width=157 height=27 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump back in as chaos escalates and tanks evolve into unstoppable (and ridiculous) machines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/59b930ba3c61eac2a88dc73650354dff.poster.avif?t=1752449019\" width=800 height=279 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/59b930ba3c61eac2a88dc73650354dff.webm?t=1752449019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck of Treads is a chaotic 2-6 player tank brawler with a deckbuilding twist. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The losers of each round pick powerful upgrades, stacking wild abilities that change how you play. Every match escalates into unpredictable mayhem with hilarious, over-the-top tank builds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/c7e444e68789adba3a83009cd9efe78d.webp?t=1752449019\" width=153 height=27 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brawl with friends in ever-changing, procedurally generated arenas where no two matches are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/2ab92cb88044074fc1d1889791f0723c.poster.avif?t=1752449019\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/2ab92cb88044074fc1d1889791f0723c.webm?t=1752449019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/6c47ff1e9506b98643bf29bc5bd0f056.webp?t=1752449019\" width=192 height=27 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The losers of each round choose powerful upgrades that transform their tanks. With endless combos and wild synergies, no two builds play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/055f222303150379489ca46b8bfbfad1.poster.avif?t=1752449019\" width=800 height=333 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/055f222303150379489ca46b8bfbfad1.webm?t=1752449019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/1dac041b5b56eb88a3d0c540821150f3.webp?t=1752449019\" width=157 height=27 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump back in as chaos escalates and tanks evolve into unstoppable (and ridiculous) machines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/59b930ba3c61eac2a88dc73650354dff.poster.avif?t=1752449019\" width=800 height=279 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321160/extras/59b930ba3c61eac2a88dc73650354dff.webm?t=1752449019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
